    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I pay for my party ticket or table?",
        "answer": "You can pay securely with Paystack using your Debit Card (Mastercard, Visa, Verve), Bank Transfer, or USSD. Your entry pass is activated immediately upon successful payment confirmation."
      },
      {
        "question": "How can the party organizer export the list of people who have paid?",
        "answer": "Organizers can click the \"Export Paid Guestlist\" button in the navigation bar or access the Admin Portal. You can download an Excel (.xlsx) spreadsheet or CSV file of all verified paid guests in one click, including their names, ticket tier, phone numbers, payment reference, and unique UUIDs."
      },
      {
        "question": "Can I buy food or drinks online beforehand?",
        "answer": "No. The party menu on this website is for viewing only so guests know what food and drinks are available. All food, grills, and drinks are purchased on-site at the party food stalls."
      },
      {
        "question": "Do group or table bookings get individual passes?",
        "answer": "Yes! For group tickets or tables, every individual person receives their own unique backend UUID and QR code pass so guests can arrive together or separately."
      },
      {
        "question": "What is the dress code for the party?",
        "answer": "Stylish Smart Casual, Chic Afrobeats Streetwear, or High Fashion Party Glam. Come ready to dance and look great!"
      }
    ]
  },
